msgstr "Parfait pour les entreprises locales et de services"

#: .\templates\pages\websites\catalog_site_plan.html:222
msgid ""
"Catalog sites work very well for local businesses and service providers. "
"Customers can explore your offerings before contacting you. This helps "
"qualify enquiries and saves time. Updates are easy when products or prices "
"change."
msgstr ""
"Les sites catalogue fonctionnent très bien pour les entreprises locales et "
"les prestataires de services. Les clients peuvent découvrir vos offres avant "
